      "bibo:abstract": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This short paper describes the \"Alligator\" Method, which converts the results of a CA into a relative chronology following Allen's interval algebra. This enables temporal reasoning and visualisation in graphs or timelines, as well as the export in standards such as RDF."
      },
